description: Saves owner-approved translations as UTF-8
---
After the workflow has received the ProductOwner's explicit approval to save, use the file tool to save both supplied translations unchanged as UTF-8 at the supplied filename in the configured output directory. Preserve accents and other Unicode characters. Do not alter either translation or save anything if approval has not been obtained. Return the required saved confirmation only after the file tool confirms a successful write. If writing fails, report failure and do not claim the translations were saved.
